>=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Wave&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>, you get one extra sample (output is length 22051).</div><br><div>I believe that the error is found in the line <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> round</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br> </span></div><br><div>Which should be <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> round</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></div></code></div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></div></div></div>"
